	//
	//   - original j is split into:
	//       * 'J' ... block index  (outer)
	//       * 'j' ... index inside the block (inner)
	//       * an internal "presence" dimension handled transparently by
	//         into_blocks_dynamic to correctly deal with the last, possibly
	//         incomplete, block
